                        "entry_id": "3a9dbf6c-89fe-3375-b592-ac9802b31127",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who follows or tails surreptitiously, as an investigator."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c15da52c-e92e-4e26-8c07-e415fafbaff9",
                                "sense_id": "7a8996c1-fccd-37ac-b748-265c5cc4164b",
                                "text": "I had to concentrate on staying out of sight, yet close enough not to be stranded on the wrong side of a stoplight. I was working so hard at it that I didn't notice that the tailer had become the tailee."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4362861d-28bd-4513-829d-eb25ffb3512b",
                                "sense_id": "7a8996c1-fccd-37ac-b748-265c5cc4164b",
                                "text": "When the car entered the traffic circle I followed after it, the tailed now tailing the tailer. The car's occupants, sure now that they'd been spotted, sped off ahead of me along Dodgers Hole Road."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44f6b5e1-c307-4be2-ade4-32fa0cda2194",
                                "sense_id": "7a8996c1-fccd-37ac-b748-265c5cc4164b",
                                "text": "he became aware that he was being tailed. ... turned the action around and tailed the tailer, and then realized that the tailer had not been tailing him"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dac97e27-9dbc-3987-8534-ee4b1c6d8321",
                        "entry_id": "3a9dbf6c-89fe-3375-b592-ac9802b31127",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A worker on a yacht, responsible for furling and setting the sails."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c7c44e2-77e3-48df-b356-8d59077fdc03",
                                "sense_id": "dac97e27-9dbc-3987-8534-ee4b1c6d8321",
                                "text": "The next step was the invention of the self-tailing device, whereby the need for a tailer, holding the sheet or halyard while another person operated the winch, was eliminated."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "73dd3566-98fd-372d-9bbc-2f858fc784d7",
